Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.07,0:03:23.92,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士　女士　求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am. Ma'am, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮我一把　-不行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, can you help me? - No no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.01,0:00:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决他们　解决他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check them all. Check them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.71,0:00:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟我带你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you out of here, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.68,0:00:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点　下士　快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, corporal. Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.74,0:01:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着　如果你要醒过来　求你马上醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. If you're gonna wake up, I need you to do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗　快醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了兄弟　给我点提示　随便什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, man, just show me a sign. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.59,0:01:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了　瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.34,0:01:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方要陷落了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place is coming down!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.06,0:01:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退　所有人员都撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back! All units fall back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.35,0:02:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.30,0:02:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔　你掩护后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, you cover the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.57,0:03:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人吗　-注意门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Watch those doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.14,0:03:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch for walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.89,0:03:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有谁被感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody infected?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.79,0:03:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of our group was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:04:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没撑到这\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.11,0:04:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么来这　你们要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here? What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.99,0:04:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头这也算是奢望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's asking an awful lot these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.17,0:04:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都得做个血液检测\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all submit to a blood test.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,检测完才能进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the price of admission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.61,0:04:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.42,0:04:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把行李都弄进来　马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got stuff to bring in, you do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.70,0:04:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这门要是关了　就开不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once this door closes, it stays closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,维　密封大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vi, seal the main entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭这里的电源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the power up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是瑞克·格兰姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick Grimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是埃德温·詹纳博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Edwin Jenner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:05:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士们四处走动时都拿着枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctors always go around packing heat like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面躺着很多行尸呢　我很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were plenty left lying around. I familiarized myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.65,0:05:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你们看上去没什么威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you look harmless enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会盯着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to keep my eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在地下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we underground?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有幽闭恐怖症吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you claustrophobic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有点　-别去想就不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A little. - Try not to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.57,0:05:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,维　把大厅的灯点亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vi, bring up the lights in the big room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.10,0:05:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到第五区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to zone 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.47,0:05:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他博士和员工呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other doctors, the staff?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.23,0:05:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿只有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.51,0:05:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你刚跟谁说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the person you were speaking with?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.46,0:06:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,维\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.22,0:06:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,维　跟大家打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vi, say hello to our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.64,0:06:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎下大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them… welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.02,0:06:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好　欢迎你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, guests. Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.71,0:06:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就剩下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all that's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.26,0:06:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大家失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.77,0:06:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有什么意义　如果我们被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point? If we were infected,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.97,0:06:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会发烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'd all be running a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.85,0:06:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你们放进来　已经违反了所有规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already broken every rule in the book letting you in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少让我守一点点规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me just at least be thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.41,0:06:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.57,0:06:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她几天没吃东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hasn't eaten in days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.49,0:06:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.31,0:06:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.15,0:06:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗　在意大利\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, in Italy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃饭时　孩子们也可以喝点小酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}children have a little bit of wine with dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.32,0:06:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在法国也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in France.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.92,0:06:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是卡尔在意大利或法国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when Carl is in Italy or France,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.72,0:07:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那他也可以喝点　-这有什么大不了　拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- he can have some then. - What's it gonna hurt? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,通融一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,给　小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, young lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my boy. That's my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.08,0:07:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乖孩子　-好难喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good boy. - Yuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.98,0:07:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真难喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}That tastes nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.23,0:07:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是喝点果汁吧　伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just stick to sour pop there, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没说你　格伦　-什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not you, Glenn. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续喝　小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep drinking, little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.77,0:07:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想瞧瞧你能脸红到什么地步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see how red your face can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.31,0:07:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像还没正式感谢招待我们的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems to me we haven't thanked our host properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为我们所做的远不止这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is more than just our host.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干　干　-敬你一杯　博士　干\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hear hear! - Here's to you, doc. Booyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干　-谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Booyah! - Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.21,0:07:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Booyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.68,0:07:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你啥时准备告诉我们这里的事　博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when are you gonna tell us what the hell happened here, doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的那些博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the… the other doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.50,0:08:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,本该在这里研究对策\N{\fnArial\fs30}that were supposed to be figuring out what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们到哪去了　-咱们在庆祝　肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are they? - We're celebrating, Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在别说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't need to do this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.03,0:08:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着　这正是我们此行的目的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, wait a second. This is why we're here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.36,0:08:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was your move…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.27,0:08:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是要寻找答案吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}supposed to find all the answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead we…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.80,0:08:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}we found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.17,0:08:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只找到一个人　为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found one man. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,灾难降临后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when things got bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人都走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a lot of people just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.61,0:08:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,找他们的家人去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went off to be with their families.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.79,0:08:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来形势恶化\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when things got worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,军事防御被击溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the military cordon got overrun,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.42,0:08:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人都逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the rest bolted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every last one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.69,0:08:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不　很多人无法面对外面的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, many couldn't face walking out the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}They… opted out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.49,0:08:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多人都自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a rash of suicides.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.71,0:08:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不堪回首\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a bad time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.65,0:09:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just kept working.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,想做点有用的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoping to do some good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.01,0:09:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真扫大家的兴　伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you are such a buzzkill, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,中心大多地方都断电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the facility is powered down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.59,0:09:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括宿舍　所以你们只能在这凑合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including housing, so you'll have to make do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.76,0:09:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙发挺舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}The couches are comfortable,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.23,0:09:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢的话仓库里还有吊床\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there are cots in storage if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.88,0:09:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,大厅那边有个娱乐室　孩子们可能会喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a rec room down the hall that you kids might enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是不要玩电子游戏　好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't plug in the video games, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.91,0:09:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何要用电的都不行　同样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or anything that draws power. The same applies…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.77,0:09:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们要洗澡　用热水好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you shower, go easy on the hot water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,热水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot water?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the man said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.91,0:10:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来　吐出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Get it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… god.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝下去总比吐出来好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always better going down than coming up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.11,0:11:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说酒　戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean the wine, Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了　一切都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's over. There's nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I… I see a…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.15,0:11:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒是个重新开始的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chance to make a new start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.63,0:11:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天啊　戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god, Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔　你没看到詹纳的表情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale, didn't you see the look on Jenner's face?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.91,0:11:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.43,0:12:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.30,0:12:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,血液检验怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.34,0:12:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}No surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来谢谢你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.01,0:12:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你谢过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.90,0:12:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all… you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.66,0:12:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道是什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.51,0:12:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道外面世界是什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what it's like out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.21,0:12:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你知道　其实不然\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may think you do, but you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.21,0:12:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在外面会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd have died out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是时间问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.85,0:12:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too many of those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.53,0:12:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My… my boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妻子　我从没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My… my wife, I never…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.73,0:13:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没告诉过他们我真实的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never told 'em what I really thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.31,0:13:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至连一点暗示都没　只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never even hinted, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.77,0:13:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是闷在心里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kept it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.97,0:13:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,闷在心里　让大家心怀希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kept it in and kept us moving, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.35,0:13:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,闷在心里　让大家心怀…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kept it in. Kept us…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll all be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好书吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any good books?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,够我们看上好几年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to keep us busy for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了　孩子们　该睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on, kids, it's bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝儿　你们去睡前祈祷吧　我再看会书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, go say your prayers. I'm gonna browse a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:14:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们第一次能睡个好觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the first night we might actually get some real sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.52,0:14:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是奇迹　不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a miracle, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.64,0:14:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天　你吓死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, you scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟你说些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna tell you a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.70,0:14:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我好好听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is not the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.73,0:14:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了　那又该什么时候说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. When is it ever the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.33,0:14:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这么对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you treat me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.90,0:14:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你开玩笑吧　-不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're kidding, right? - No. Huh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你告诉我　我丈夫死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you told me my husband was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有撒谎　好吗　真的没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't lie to you, all right? I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道医院里的情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what it was like there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.40,0:14:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说　一切都崩溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. Things were falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.66,0:15:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在过道里杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were slaughtering people in the hallways.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是场大屠杀　到处都有行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a massacre. There were walkers everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就这么扔下他了　-大家都跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you left him? - Everybody else ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有医生　只剩下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were no doctors there. It was just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他身上连着仪器　我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was hooked up to machines and I did not know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.69,0:15:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至贴着他的胸膛听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even took my ear and I put it on his chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,想听听有没有心跳　结果没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I listened for a heartbeat and I did not hear one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.73,0:15:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I-I-I-I… I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.25,0:15:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是此起彼伏的枪声　我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it was gunfire. I don't know what it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.15,0:15:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他没可能活下来　绝对没可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was no way he could've survived that. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但他活下来了　-对　但我还得考虑你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He did. - Yeah, but then I had y'all to think about, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.74,0:15:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你和卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had you and Carl,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.41,0:15:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得考虑你们的安危　-不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and I needed to think about… - okay. No no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得把你们平安送到亚特兰大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to get you guys safe to Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须这样　别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I had to do. Just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.94,0:15:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you thought for one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.54,0:15:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他还活着　你会离开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he was still alive, would you have come?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.07,0:15:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说我救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I saved your life…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你儿子　我救了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your little boy's. That's what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.82,0:15:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要我和他交换　我也愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I could've traded places with him, I would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.28,0:15:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就愿意和他换\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would trade places with him right now because…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.65,0:15:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不　你听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no no, you…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你　-不　你喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you. Shh shh. - No. No, you're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.46,0:15:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你　-你喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you. - No, you're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:15:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你也爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know there were some things that say that you love me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:15:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because there's no way that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会对我这么冷淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could've been with me the way that you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩　住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane. Shane. Shane!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.87,0:16:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着　你爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. You love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我　快放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands off me. Get your hands off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你　这里没别人　-不要　快住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you. There's nobody here. - Please! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样　洛莉　没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, Lori. It's all right. Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不用再害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to be afraid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.01,0:17:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.02,0:17:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早　-你宿醉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning. - Are you hungover?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.34,0:17:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈就说你会　-妈妈说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom said you'd be. - Mom is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.11,0:17:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈总说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom has that annoying habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,糊状的鸡蛋　但还算美味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eggs. Powdered, but… but I do 'em good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.86,0:18:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你吃不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you can't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.56,0:18:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋白质有助于治宿醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protein helps the hangover.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.12,0:18:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都哪儿来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd all this come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹纳给的　-能帮我一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jenner. - could you help me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得我们用得着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought we could use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.47,0:18:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢了　-至少是少部分人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Some of us, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.31,0:18:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不要让我喝酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever ever ever let me drink again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉和我一样糟糕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel as bad as I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.18,0:18:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你那脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your neck?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.74,0:18:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是睡觉时弄到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have done it in my sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前睡觉可没弄伤过啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen you do that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.18,0:18:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.52,0:18:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再是以前的我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各位早　-博士早\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning.　- Hey, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.41,0:18:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士　我不想一大早上来就问你问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, I don't mean to slam you with questions first thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.83,0:18:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还是会问\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.73,0:18:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不是来蹭饭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't come here for the eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.86,0:19:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,回放19号试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me playback of TS-19.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.88,0:19:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,回放19号试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playback of TS-19.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.29,0:19:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很少人看过这些资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Few people ever got a chance to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.19,0:19:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very few.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是大脑吗　-一个杰出的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that a brain?　- An extraordinary one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,抛开结果不说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that it matters in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.62,0:19:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,展示内部放大视图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us in for E.I.V…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,内部放大视图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enhanced internal view.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些亮斑是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are those lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个人的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a person's life…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.79,0:19:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历　还有记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}experiences, memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.39,0:20:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的这些组织网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere in all that organic wiring,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.03,0:20:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的这些亮斑\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those ripples of light,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.18,0:20:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,造就了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}is you…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.00,0:20:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你变得独一无二\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing that makes you unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.85,0:20:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,变得有人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}And human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.20,0:20:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是听不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't make sense ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.11,0:20:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是神经突触\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are synapses,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.65,0:20:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大脑中的电子脉冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}electric impulses in the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.45,0:20:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,运载着一切信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}that carry all the messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你刚出生开始　它就控制着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They determine everything a person says.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.25,0:20:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的所说所做和所想\N{\fnArial\fs30}does or thinks from the moment of birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the moment of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到死亡　这是监测图像吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death? That's what this is, a vigil?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确说是监测图像的回放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or rather the playback of the vigil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.43,0:20:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This person died?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.12,0:20:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.06,0:20:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,19号试验品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Test subject 19.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个被咬　感染上病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who was bitten and infected…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.69,0:20:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还自愿让我们记录下转变过程的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and volunteered to have us record the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.98,0:21:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,维　浏览项目一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vi, scan forward to the first event.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.53,0:21:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,浏览项目一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scanning to first event.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.14,0:21:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.47,0:21:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就像脑膜炎一样感染大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It invades the brain like meningitis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,导致肾上腺出血\N{\fnArial\fs30}The adrenal glands hemorrhage,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.12,0:21:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,大脑停止运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}the brian goes into shutdown,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.01,0:21:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后到主要器官\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the major organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.41,0:21:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.38,0:21:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的过去与未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you ever were or ever will be…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.89,0:21:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,都消逝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.37,0:21:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆也会这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what happened to Jim?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.15,0:21:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.47,0:21:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天前她失去了一个亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She lost somebody two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.71,0:21:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.75,0:21:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也失去了亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost somebody too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.97,0:22:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这有多难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how devastating it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.20,0:22:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,浏览项目二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scan to the second event.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.18,0:22:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,浏览项目二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scanning to second event.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.90,0:22:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,变异时间有长有短\N{\fnArial\fs30}The resurrection times vary wildly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.07,0:22:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告说　短的有三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had reports of it happening in as little as three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.53,0:22:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,最长有八小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}The longest we heard of was eight hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.01,0:22:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于这个病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the case of this patient,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.27,0:22:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是两小时一分\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was two hours, one minute…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.02,0:22:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,零七秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它让大脑重新运作吗　-不　只是脑干\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It restarts the brain?　- No, just the brain stem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.95,0:22:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,原理上说　是让行尸起来走动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, it gets them up and moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.53,0:22:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们不是活的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're not alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.31,0:22:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.18,0:22:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,和以前不同了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.00,0:22:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大脑大部分都是黑暗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of that brain is dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.34,0:23:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗　毫无生机　说明死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark, lifeless, dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.17,0:23:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,大脑额叶　脑皮层\N{\fnArial\fs30}The frontal lobe, the neocortex,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.80,0:23:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,属于人的那部分　没活过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human part… that doesn't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.18,0:23:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你活着的那部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}The you part.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.01,0:23:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一具没有思想　只由本能控制的躯壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a shell driven by mindless instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.18,0:23:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊　怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.20,0:23:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他朝那病人的头射了一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shot his patient in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.42,0:23:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.18,0:23:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,维　关闭主屏和工作台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vi, power down the main screen and the workstations.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.94,0:23:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭主屏和工作台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Powering down main screen and workstations.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.59,0:23:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也弄不清那是什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what it is, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.71,0:23:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是细菌　病毒　寄生菌　或真菌\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be microbial, viral, parasitic, fungal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.73,0:23:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,抑或是上帝的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the wrath of god?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.89,0:23:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.98,0:23:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有人知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody must know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.98,0:23:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在某处的什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.72,0:23:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他人　对吧　其他机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are others, right? Other facilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.83,0:23:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There may be some.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.92,0:24:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.60,0:24:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不知道　你怎么可能什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't know? How can you not know?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.86,0:24:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.39,0:24:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,通讯　上级指示　都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Communications, directives… all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.47,0:24:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经活在黑暗中快一个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been in the dark for almost a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.50,0:24:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么说　不光是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's not just here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.06,0:24:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管在哪都是一无所有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing left anywhere? Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.84,0:24:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你其实是这个意思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you're really saying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.73,0:24:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.82,0:24:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们　我又想去大醉一场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I'm gonna get soon faced drunk again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.03,0:24:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹纳博士　我知道你已经很难做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jenner, I know this has been taxing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.87,0:24:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再问问题了　但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I hate to ask one more question, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.24,0:24:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That clock…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.86,0:24:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在倒计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's counting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.42,0:24:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,数到零时会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens at zero?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.58,0:24:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下室的发电机没燃料了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The basement generators… they run out of fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.01,0:24:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.86,0:25:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,维　电力耗尽会发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vi, what happens when the power runs out?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.07,0:25:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,电力耗尽后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the power runs out,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.73,0:25:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会进行全面消毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}facility-wide decontamination will occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.95,0:25:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,消毒　那意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decontamination… what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.38,0:25:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太喜欢詹纳他拒不开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like the way Jenner clammed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.53,0:25:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就那么走开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way he just wandered off like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.83,0:25:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么了　说真的　伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with him? Seriously, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.57,0:25:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他傻了　嗑药了　还是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he nuts, medicated, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.75,0:25:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}In there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.81,0:25:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那边看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.02,0:25:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.64,0:26:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.98,0:26:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开启应急照明　-这怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Emergency lighting on. - What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.31,0:26:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂　你们关了灯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you guys kill the lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.39,0:26:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不　它自己灭了　-有什么发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nah, it just went ou. - Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.13,0:26:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有　一堆停止运转的发电机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a lot of dead generators.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.18,0:26:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,和数不清的空燃料桶\N{\fnArial\fs30}and more empty fuel drums than I can count.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.86,0:26:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定不会只剩这一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be down to just that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.11,0:26:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈　出什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.24,0:26:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事　只不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.32,0:26:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,空调停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the air conditioning stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.06,0:27:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间有限　但我已经尽最大努力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did the best I could in the time that I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.47,0:27:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能以此为傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you'd be proud of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.04,0:27:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总以为还有很长路要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We always think there's gonna be more time…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.24,0:27:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不知不觉已到尽头\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then it runs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.36,0:27:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,空调怎么停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is the air off?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.40,0:27:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有房间里的灯也灭了　-怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and the lights in our room? - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.93,0:27:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么所有电器都停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is everything turned off?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.53,0:27:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在优先化能源耗用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Energy use is being prioritized.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.34,0:27:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,空调不是最重要的吗　还有灯呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Air isn't a priority? And lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.77,0:28:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我决定的　第五区在自行关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not up to me. Zone 5 is shutting itself down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.02,0:28:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂　喂　这话是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, what the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.27,0:28:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟　我问你话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey man, I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.29,0:28:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫自行关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean it's shutting itself down?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.38,0:28:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一所建筑怎么有这能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can a building do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.16,0:28:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不知道的事还多着呢　-瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'd be surprised. - Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.64,0:28:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹纳　怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenner, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.49,0:28:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统正在终止一切非必需设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system is dropping all the nonessential uses of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.30,0:28:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了尽可能保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's designed to keep the.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.23,0:28:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑运行时间　直到最后一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}computers running to the last possible second.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.34,0:28:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当剩余时间接近半小时　程序就会启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}That started as we approached the half-hour mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.83,0:28:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.68,0:28:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 法国人　-什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was the French. - what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.69,0:28:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知　他们坚持到了最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were the last ones to hold out as far as I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.99,0:28:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们的人或夺门而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}While our people were bolting out the doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.55,0:28:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,或在过道里自杀时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and committing suicide in the hallways,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.13,0:28:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一直留守在实验室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}they stayed in the labs till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.66,0:28:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们自认为快要找出解决之道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They thought they were close to a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.33,0:28:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.23,0:28:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟这里情况一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same thing that's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.37,0:29:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,电力耗尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}No power grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.58,0:29:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹尽粮绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ran out of juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.60,0:29:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个世界的运转都依赖于矿物燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world runs on fossil fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.58,0:29:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是荒天下之大谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how stupid is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.03,0:29:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我告诉你　-见鬼去吧　肖恩　我才不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me tell you… - To hell with it, Shane. I don't even care.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.56,0:29:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉　去收拾东西　大家都收拾下东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, grab our things. Everybody, get your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.09,0:29:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.19,0:29:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.88,0:29:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.51,0:29:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.40,0:29:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,距消毒程序启动还有三十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}30 minutes to decontamination.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.53,0:29:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士　这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.34,0:29:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们大家都听见瑞克说的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, y'all heard Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.07,0:29:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾东西　咱们马上离开　快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your stuff and let's go! Go now! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.82,0:29:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走　-快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.73,0:29:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.20,0:29:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是把我们锁在里面了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just lock us in?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.26,0:29:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把我们锁在里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just locked us in!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.45,0:29:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十分钟时限开始　我在记录中\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've hit the 30-minute window. I am recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.73,0:29:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔　-妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl. - Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.25,0:29:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你个狗娘养的　-肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You son of a bitch. - Shane!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.03,0:29:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你快放我们出去　-不　停手　不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You let us out of here! - No, stop. Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.03,0:30:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 满口胡言的　-不　不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You lying… - No no no no!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.86,0:30:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等　别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, no! No, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.34,0:30:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹纳　立刻开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jenner, open that door now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.77,0:30:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用的　上面的出口全都关闭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no point. Everything topside is locked down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.21,0:30:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急通道也封锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emergency exits are sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.71,0:30:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他妈的就打开啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, open the damn things.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.21,0:30:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法控制　是电脑操控的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not something I control. The computers do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.45,0:30:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你们　前门一旦关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you once that front door closed,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.48,0:30:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就再也无法开启了　你们当时都听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it wouldn't open again. You heard me say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.39,0:30:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样更好一点　-怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's better this way. - What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.58,0:30:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,28分钟以后会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens in 28 minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.69,0:30:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 28分钟以后会怎样　-够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happens in 28 minutes??! - COME ON!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.13,0:30:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what this place is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.26,0:30:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里面存放的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We protected the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.18,0:30:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,危害性相当强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}from very nasty stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.74,0:30:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,生化武器　天花病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weaponized smallpox!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.18,0:30:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,能夺去半数国民生命的埃博拉菌株\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ebola strains that could wipe out half the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.42,0:30:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是你们死都不想泄露出去的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff you don't want getting out! Ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.43,0:31:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生灾难性电力故障时\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the event of a catastrophic power failure…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.20,0:31:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如在恐怖袭击中\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a terrorist attack, for example…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.84,0:31:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统会启动HIT　以禁止任何有机体离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}H.I.T.s are deployed to prevent any organisms from getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.26,0:31:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,HIT\N{\fnArial\fs30}H.I.T.s?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.07,0:31:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维　解释下　-HIT\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vi, define. - HITs…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.05,0:31:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,指强脉冲温压油气炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}high-impulse thermobaric fuel-air explosives.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.93,0:31:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,包含两阶段气溶胶点火装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}cocoists of a two-stage aerosol ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.94,0:31:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,使其产生的冲击波　破坏力与持久性\N{\fnArial\fs30}that produces a blast wave of significantly greater power.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.25,0:31:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,均优于所有已知炸药　仅次于核武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}and duration than any other known explosive except nuclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.64,0:31:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在真空压力下　于五千度至六千度间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vacuum-pressure effect ignites the oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.44,0:31:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,点燃氧气\N{\fnArial\fs30}between 5, 000 and 6, 000 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.19,0:31:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可导致极其惨重的人员伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is used when the greatest loss of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.75,0:31:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,和财产损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}and damage to structures is desired.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.89,0:31:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会点燃空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sets the air on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.40,0:31:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.61,0:31:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再无忧伤　悲痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}An end to sorrow, grief…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.20,0:31:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,懊悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.77,0:32:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.23,0:32:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the damn door!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.81,0:32:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.61,0:32:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.12,0:32:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺其自然吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've left well enough alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.63,0:32:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会好过许多　-谁会好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- it would've been so much easier. - Easier for who?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.61,0:32:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都会　你们清楚外面的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you. You know what's out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.12,0:32:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,生不能安寝　死不得安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}A short, brutal life and an agonizing death.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.03,0:32:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹妹　叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your… your sister… what was her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.89,0:32:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾米　-艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amy. - Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.93,0:32:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白最终会是怎样的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what this does.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.19,0:32:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲眼所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.48,0:32:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让妻子和儿子落得那种下场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that really what you want for your wife and son?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.51,0:32:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.27,0:32:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't make a dent.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.34,0:33:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些门都能经受火箭袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those doors are designed to withstand a rocket launcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.10,0:33:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的脑袋可受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your head ain't!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.16,0:33:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔　达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl! Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.10,0:33:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退　住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just back up! Back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.91,0:33:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.92,0:33:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天晚上你说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.66,0:33:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你心爱的人迟早会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}you knew it was just a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.86,0:33:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是时间问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}before everybody you loved was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.31,0:33:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.49,0:33:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么　你真这么说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You really said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.49,0:33:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你之前说的大话算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all your big talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.12,0:33:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须时刻保持希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to keep hope alive, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.85,0:33:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.62,0:33:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从来就没有希望　-希望总是存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- there never was. - There's always hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.45,0:33:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不是你　也许不在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it won't be you, maybe not here,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.11,0:33:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在其他地方总会有人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But somebody somewhere…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.29,0:33:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的一切都完了　你还不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What part of "Everything is gone" Do you not understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.36,0:33:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你朋友的吧　她明白这道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to your friend. She gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.79,0:33:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我们经历的浩劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what takes us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.69,0:33:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是灭绝之灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our extinction event.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.68,0:33:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.55,0:33:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能把我们关在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just keep us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.55,0:33:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那么一瞬间\N{\fnArial\fs30}One tiny moment…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.86,0:33:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,千分之一秒　毫无痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}A millisecond. No pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.86,0:34:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿不该这样死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter doesn't deserve to die like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.43,0:34:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这难道还不够仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't it be kinder,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.03,0:34:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够怜悯吗　抱着你所爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}more compassionate to just hold your loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.00,0:34:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢等待生命的终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wait for the clock to run down?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.81,0:34:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肖恩　住手　-闪开　瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shane, no! - Out of the way, Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.54,0:34:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我闪开　快开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay out of my way! Open that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.04,0:34:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我让你脑袋开花　听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'm gonna blow your head off. Do you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.85,0:34:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们　你不能做这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, brother, this is not the way you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.95,0:34:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样我们出不去　-肖恩　你听他一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We will never get out of here. - Shane, you listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.45,0:34:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太迟了　-要是他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's too late. - He dies, we all…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.79,0:34:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都死定了　肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}we all die! Shane!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.05,0:34:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.27,0:34:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你够了吗　你闹完了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you done now? Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.28,0:34:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的　我想我们都完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess we all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.41,0:35:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.37,0:35:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么　-你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.14,0:35:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说毫无希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}About no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.84,0:35:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真是这样　你早和大家一起跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that were true, you'd have bolted with the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.37,0:35:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者死了一了百了　但你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}or taken the easy way out. You didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.94,0:35:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却做了更艰难的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose the hard path.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.04,0:35:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么　-无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.95,0:35:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有所谓　不可能无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does matter. It always matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.69,0:35:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人逃走你却选择留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stayed when others ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.11,0:35:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底为什么　-不是我想留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Not because I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.96,0:35:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做过承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a promise…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.80,0:35:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对她\N{\fnArial\fs30}To her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.31,0:35:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.44,0:35:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,19号试验品是你妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Test subject 19 was your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.51,0:36:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她求我尽全力继续研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}She begged me to keep going as long as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.72,0:36:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么拒绝得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I say no?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.65,0:36:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.46,0:36:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,死的应该是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should've been me on that table.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.29,0:36:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本毫无价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have mattered to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.29,0:36:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而她的死却是全世界的损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a loss to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.09,0:36:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼　她是这儿的领导　而我只是下属\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, she ran this place. I just worked here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.97,0:36:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是这个领域的奇才\N{\fnArial\fs30}In our field, she was an Einstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.70,0:36:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呢　我不过是个无名小卒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? I'm just… Edwin Jenner.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.10,0:36:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她本可以有所作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could've done something about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.43,0:36:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.45,0:36:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.22,0:36:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却有　我们想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do. That's… that's all we want…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.48,0:36:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一个选择　去赌一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}A choice, a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.09,0:36:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们尽全力去尝试一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us keep trying as long as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.39,0:36:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了外门已封锁　我开不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you topside's locked down. I can't open those.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.84,0:37:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.14,0:37:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走　-快点　快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go! - Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.14,0:37:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点　-快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Move it! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.28,0:37:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点走　-我们离开这儿　索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, let's go! - We're gonna get out of here, Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.92,0:37:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的机会　去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's your chance. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.66,0:37:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.06,0:37:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你总有一天会改变主意　-快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The day will come when you won't be. - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.68,0:37:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只剩4分钟了　快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we've got four minutes left! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.44,0:37:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走　-不　我要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. Let's go. - No no, I'm staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.17,0:37:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要留下　亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.14,0:37:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这是疯了　-不　我很理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But that's insane! - no, it's completely sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.72,0:37:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么久以来从没这么理智过\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.12,0:37:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想变成吉姆和艾米那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not ending up like Jim and Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.68,0:37:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间争论了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no time to argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.99,0:38:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有意义　你们快出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no point, not if you want to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.82,0:38:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去吧　快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get out. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.86,0:38:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔　快走　伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dog. Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.39,0:38:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点　快走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.60,0:38:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.75,0:38:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不　安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.32,0:38:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们先走　-快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just go! Go! - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.66,0:38:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.46,0:38:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米不希望你这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't what Amy would want for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.56,0:38:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了　你得快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead, and you need to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.21,0:38:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快把门打开　-拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get them doors open! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.85,0:38:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行　-等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It doesn't work! - Wait a minute! Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.18,0:38:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try it! Try it! Try it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.41,0:39:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快开啊　-跟紧我　宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! Come on! - Stay close, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.53,0:39:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's almost up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.83,0:39:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔　小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.53,0:39:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔　快下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dog, get down! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.17,0:39:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天　-这玻璃打不碎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus. - The glass won't break?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.75,0:39:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克　我这里有东西可能有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, I have something that might help.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.74,0:39:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔　指甲锉可派不上用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol, I don't think a nail file's gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.68,0:39:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚到营地时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your first morning at camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.68,0:39:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你洗制服时在口袋里找到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I washed your uniform I found this in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.46,0:39:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.58,0:39:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.40,0:40:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快趴下　-见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get down! Get down! - Shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.64,0:40:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.41,0:40:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.25,0:40:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在做什么　-我说好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - I said okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.50,0:40:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别开玩笑了　戴尔　-我没开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't pull this, Dale. - I'm not pulling anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.79,0:40:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你留下　我也留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're staying, I stay too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.40,0:40:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的没错　我们都知道出去会有什么后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right. We know what's waiting for us out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.57,0:40:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想独自去面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to face it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.67,0:40:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔　见鬼的　你快出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale, get the hell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.47,0:40:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想你留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.04,0:40:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,太糟糕了　你不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad. See, you don't get to do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.05,0:40:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,走进某人的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}to… to come into somebody's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.06,0:40:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他在乎你后又一走了之\N{\fnArial\fs30}make them care and then just check out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.63,0:40:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.63,0:41:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The matter is settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.16,0:41:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait wait wait. Wait wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.82,0:41:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.09,0:41:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.81,0:42:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.76,0:42:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔　卧倒　快卧倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale, get down! Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.72,0:42:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,到里面去　大家都卧倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back! Everybody down! Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.92,0:42:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.76,0:43:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧　快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.33,0:43:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点　上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on. Get in, get in, get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.17,0:43:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in!
